{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 3,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 385.323,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.387,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Nephites who were not slain by the weapons of war,",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.567,
      "end": 8.168,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after having buried those who had been slain\u2014",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.348,
      "end": 13.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "now the number of the slain were not numbered, because of the greatness of their number\u2014",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 14.147,
      "end": 17.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after they had finished burying their dead",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 17.206,
      "end": 19.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they all returned to their lands,",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 19.522,
      "end": 22.773,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to their houses, and their wives, and their children.",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 23.453,
      "end": 30.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now many women and children had been slain with the sword, and also many of their flocks and their herds;",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 30.413,
      "end": 33.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also many of their fields of grain were destroyed,",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 33.658,
      "end": 36.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they were trodden down by the hosts of men.",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 37.357,
      "end": 44.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now as many of the Lamanites and the Amlicites who had been slain upon the bank of the river Sidon",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 44.967,
      "end": 47.475,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were cast into the waters of Sidon;",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 47.655,
      "end": 50.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold their bones are in the depths of the sea,",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 51.179,
      "end": 52.619,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are many.",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 53.299,
      "end": 56.225,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Amlicites were distinguished from the Nephites,",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 56.405,
      "end": 62.396,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they had marked themselves with red in their foreheads after the manner of the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 62.576,
      "end": 66.848,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless they had not shorn their heads like unto the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 67.528,
      "end": 70.036,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the heads of the Lamanites were shorn;",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 70.216,
      "end": 71.609,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were naked,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 71.789,
      "end": 75.922,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were skin which was girded about their loins,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 76.102,
      "end": 79.446,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also their armor, which was girded about them,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 79.626,
      "end": 84.92,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their bows, and their arrows, and their stones, and their slings, and so forth.",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 85.6,
      "end": 91.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the skins of the Lamanites were dark, according to the mark which was set upon their fathers,",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 91.539,
      "end": 97.762,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was a curse upon them because of their transgression and their rebellion against their brethren,",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 97.942,
      "end": 101.518,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who consisted of Nephi, Jacob, and Joseph, and Sam,",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 101.698,
      "end": 103.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who were just and holy men.",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 104.236,
      "end": 106.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And their brethren sought to destroy them,",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 106.877,
      "end": 108.735,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they were cursed;",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 108.915,
      "end": 111.516,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lord God set a mark upon them,",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 111.696,
      "end": 117.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, upon Laman and Lemuel, and also the sons of Ishmael, and Ishmaelitish women.",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 117.902,
      "end": 119.574,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this was done",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 119.754,
      "end": 124.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that their seed might be distinguished from the seed of their brethren,",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 124.578,
      "end": 127.736,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby the Lord God might preserve his people,",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 127.916,
      "end": 133.814,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might not mix and believe in incorrect traditions which would prove their destruction.",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 134.494,
      "end": 139.927,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that whosoever did mingle his seed with that of the Lamanites",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 140.107,
      "end": 142.336,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did bring the same curse upon his seed.",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 143.016,
      "end": 147.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, whosoever suffered himself to be led away by the Lamanites",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 147.468,
      "end": 149.326,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "was called under that head,",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 149.506,
      "end": 151.735,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there was a mark set upon him.",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 152.415,
      "end": 157.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that whosoever would not believe in the tradition of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 157.936,
      "end": 162.58,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but believed those records which were brought out of the land of Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 162.76,
      "end": 166.893,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also in the tradition of their fathers, which were correct,",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 167.073,
      "end": 170.324,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who believed in the commandments of God and kept them,",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 170.504,
      "end": 175.194,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were called the Nephites, or the people of Nephi, from that time forth\u2014",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 175.874,
      "end": 184.094,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it is they who have kept the records which are true of their people, and also of the people of the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 184.774,
      "end": 187.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now we will return again to the Amlicites,",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 187.973,
      "end": 190.667,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they also had a mark set upon them;",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 190.847,
      "end": 193.169,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, they set the mark upon themselves,",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 193.349,
      "end": 196.553,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even a mark of red upon their foreheads.",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 197.233,
      "end": 199.462,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus the word of God is fulfilled,",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 199.642,
      "end": 202.475,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for these are the words which he said to Nephi:",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 202.655,
      "end": 205.023,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, the Lamanites have I cursed,",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 205.203,
      "end": 207.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will set a mark on them",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 207.519,
      "end": 212.302,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they and their seed may be separated from thee and thy seed,",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 212.482,
      "end": 215.036,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from this time henceforth and forever,",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 215.216,
      "end": 218.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except they repent of their wickedness and turn to me",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 218.786,
      "end": 221.154,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may have mercy upon them.",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 221.834,
      "end": 223.041,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again:",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 223.221,
      "end": 227.772,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will set a mark upon him that mingleth his seed with thy brethren",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 227.952,
      "end": 230.274,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may be cursed also.",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 230.954,
      "end": 232.161,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again:",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 232.341,
      "end": 236.939,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will set a mark upon him that fighteth against thee and thy seed.",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 237.619,
      "end": 239.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again, I say",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 239.332,
      "end": 243.14,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he that departeth from thee shall no more be called thy seed;",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 243.32,
      "end": 244.806,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will bless thee,",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 244.986,
      "end": 247.865,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whomsoever shall be called thy seed,",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 248.045,
      "end": 249.578,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "henceforth and forever;",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 249.758,
      "end": 254.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and these were the promises of the Lord unto Nephi and to his seed.",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 254.943,
      "end": 259.959,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the Amlicites knew not that they were fulfilling the words of God",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 260.139,
      "end": 263.39,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when they began to mark themselves in their foreheads;",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 263.57,
      "end": 267.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless they had come out in open rebellion against God;",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 267.697,
      "end": 271.459,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore it was expedient that the curse should fall upon them.",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 272.139,
      "end": 277.015,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I would that ye should see that they brought upon themselves the curse;",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 277.195,
      "end": 279.842,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and even so doth every man that is cursed",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 280.022,
      "end": 282.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "bring upon himself his own condemnation.",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 283.349,
      "end": 293.287,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now it came to pass that not many days after the battle which was fought in the land of Zarahemla, by the Lamanites and the Amlicites,",
      "verse": "3:20",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 293.467,
      "end": 302.151,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there was another army of the Lamanites came in upon the people of Nephi, in the same place where the first army met the Amlicites.",
      "verse": "3:20",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 302.831,
      "end": 307.754,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that there was an army sent to drive them out of their land.",
      "verse": "3:21",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 308.434,
      "end": 311.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now Alma himself being afflicted with a wound",
      "verse": "3:22",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 311.772,
      "end": 315.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "did not go up to battle at this time against the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "3:22",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 316.121,
      "end": 318.815,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But he sent up a numerous army against them;",
      "verse": "3:23",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 318.995,
      "end": 320.945,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they went up",
      "verse": "3:23",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 321.125,
      "end": 323.215,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and slew many of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "3:23",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 323.395,
      "end": 327.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and drove the remainder of them out of the borders of their land.",
      "verse": "3:23",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 328.626,
      "end": 330.948,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then they returned again",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 331.128,
      "end": 337.769,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to establish peace in the land, being troubled no more for a time with their enemies.",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 338.449,
      "end": 340.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now all these things were done,",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 340.533,
      "end": 343.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, all these wars and contentions",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 343.267,
      "end": 348.329,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were commenced and ended in the fifth year of the reign of the judges.",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 349.009,
      "end": 352.631,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And in one year were thousands and tens of thousands of souls",
      "verse": "3:26",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 352.811,
      "end": 354.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "sent to the eternal world,",
      "verse": "3:26",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 354.849,
      "end": 358.378,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might reap their rewards according to their works,",
      "verse": "3:26",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 358.558,
      "end": 361.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whether they were good or whether they were bad,",
      "verse": "3:26",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 361.849,
      "end": 367.608,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to reap eternal happiness or eternal misery, according to the spirit which they listed to obey,",
      "verse": "3:26",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 367.788,
      "end": 370.574,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whether it be a good spirit or a bad one.",
      "verse": "3:26",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 371.254,
      "end": 375.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For every man receiveth wages of him whom he listeth to obey,",
      "verse": "3:27",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 375.335,
      "end": 378.632,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this according to the words of the spirit of prophecy;",
      "verse": "3:27",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 378.812,
      "end": 380.855,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore let it be according to the truth.",
      "verse": "3:27",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 381.035,
      "end": 384.657,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus endeth the fifth year of the reign of the judges.",
      "verse": "3:27",
      "lineIndex": 100
    }
  ]
}